C4 Level 3 – Component Diagram
AI Orchestrator Service (Strategic Core of Infrastructure Copilot)
As CTO/co-founder, I consider the AI Orchestrator Service the most important component in the entire platform.
The model is not the product.
The orchestration layer is the product.
Enterprise AI architecture references consistently emphasize that production AI systems require orchestration, retrieval, governance, identity controls, observability, evaluation, and tool integration around the model. They also highlight that retrieval is becoming a specialized capability and that AI systems need clear governance boundaries and auditability.

